cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference NeuroCraft Fly, please cite this project. When using
  MaleCNS-derived data, cite the original MaleCNS reconstruction separately.
type: software
title: NeuroCraft Fly
authors:
  - family-names: Smith
    given-names: Evan
    website: https://github.com/evnsnclr
abstract: >-
  Public landing page for NeuroCraft Fly, an interactive Minecraft demo with
  modeled dynamics on a retained MaleCNS fruit-fly connectome. Engineered inputs
  and hand-chosen readouts select scripted body programs. Software downloads and
  a reproducible research starter kit are being prepared for distribution.
repository-code: https://github.com/evnsnclr/neurocraft-fly-public
url: https://github.com/evnsnclr/neurocraft-fly-public
license: MIT
keywords:
  - connectomics
  - computational neuroscience
  - Minecraft
  - reproducible experiments
